<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="d0" name="0 Legend - Identity and access control"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1374" pageHeight="641" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;0  Legend - Identity and access control&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="452" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="Concept / cheat sheet" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#6B6B6B;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="502" y="19" width="160" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="675" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="How to read the diagrams in this file. Icons are draw.io&amp;#x27;s built-in Azure icon set; the orange text under each icon is the closest AWS equivalent." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1275" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="data flow" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="dashed = management / telemetry" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#7F7F7F;dashed=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="orange = private / dedicated link" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value='&lt;b&gt;Azure service name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: closest AWS&lt;br&gt;equivalent)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/compute/Virtual_Machine.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value='&lt;b&gt;Another service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: S3)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#B8860B"&gt;⚠ verify&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/storage/Storage_Accounts.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="331" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Bold text = Azure service. Orange text = closest AWS equivalent (taken&lt;br&gt;from your study document where it gives one). Amber &amp;#x27;⚠ verify&amp;#x27; = your&lt;br&gt;document flags the detail as to be verified (dates, SKUs, limits).&lt;br&gt;Amber &amp;#x27;+ added&amp;#x27; = a service I added that is not in your document." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="232" width="420" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Control / telemetry&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/security/Key_Vaults.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="583" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Observer&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/management_governance/Monitor.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="793" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Private path&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/networking/Private_Endpoint.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1045" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;PaaS target&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/databases/SQL_Database.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1255" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;A = Architecture: how pieces connect&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="62" y="434" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;D = Decision map: which service when&lt;br&gt;(table)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDF3E7;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="434" width="280" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;C = Concept / cheat sheet&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="434" width="230" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;Dashed blue/green boxes = scope or boundary&lt;br&gt;(VNet, subnet, region, subscription...)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F8E9;strokeColor=#6FA800;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="898" y="434" width="300" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="517" width="1275" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="521" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b&gt;Table colours&lt;/b&gt; → green = yes / supported, red = not supported, amber = caution, blue = key point&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Exam rules&lt;/b&gt; → each page ends with the &amp;#x27;Regla del examen&amp;#x27; pairs from the study document, translated to English" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="543" width="1241" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1_1" name="1.1 Hybrid authentication and sync: which one?"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="917" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;1.1  Hybrid authentication and sync: which one?&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="545" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Decision map" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#C55A11;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="595" y="19" width="102" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="709" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="How on-prem AD users sign in to Entra ID (PHS, PTA, AD FS) and which agent synchronises them (Connect Sync or Cloud Sync). Defaults: PHS for sign-in,&lt;br&gt;Connect Sync as the general tool." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="900" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Password Hash Sync (PHS)&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=label;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Connect.svg;imageWidth=40;imageHeight=40;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;imageBorder=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="100" width="250" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Pass-through Authentication (PTA)&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=label;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Connect.svg;imageWidth=40;imageHeight=40;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;imageBorder=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="100" width="250" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;AD FS federation&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=label;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Azure_AD_Domain_Services.svg;imageWidth=40;imageHeight=40;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;imageBorder=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="100" width="250" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;How it works&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="172" width="130" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Uploads a hash of the password hash; the&lt;br&gt;sign-in is validated in the cloud" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="172" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="Validates the password against on-prem&lt;br&gt;AD through agents" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="172" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="The identity provider stays on-prem" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="172" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;If on-prem goes&lt;br&gt;down&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="213" width="130" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="✓ Users can still sign in (resilient)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E0;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="213" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="✗ Needs the on-prem agents" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE5E5;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="213" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="✗ Needs the on-prem AD FS farm" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE5E5;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="213" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Pick it when&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="253" width="130" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="★ Default recommendation. Also detects&lt;br&gt;leaked credentials" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="253" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="★ Hashes may not be stored in the cloud" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="253" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="★ Smart cards or legacy third-party MFA&lt;br&gt;only. Most complex" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCEBFA;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="253" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value='&lt;b&gt;Entra Connect Sync&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: AD Connector)&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=label;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Connect.svg;imageWidth=40;imageHeight=40;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;imageBorder=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="515" width="370" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b&gt;Entra Cloud Sync&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=label;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;image=img/lib/azure2/other/Entra_Connect_Sync.svg;imageWidth=40;imageHeight=40;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;imageBorder=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="515" width="370" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;Agent&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="602" width="130" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="On-prem agent. Syncs users, groups and hashes" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="602" width="370" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="Lightweight agent configured from the cloud; several agents&lt;br&gt;give high availability" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="602" width="370" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;Strengths&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="642" width="130" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="Complex filtering, writeback, one or several forests. The&lt;br&gt;general option" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="642" width="370" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="Handles several disconnected AD forests (typical after a&lt;br&gt;merger)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="642" width="370" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="&lt;b&gt;Limits&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="682" width="130" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="Heavier to run" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="170" y="682" width="370" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="Not for complex rules" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="682" width="370" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="744" width="900" height="113" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="748" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="&lt;b&gt;No password hashes in the cloud&lt;/b&gt; → Pass-through Authentication (PTA)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Simple and resilient&lt;/b&gt; → Password Hash Sync (PHS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Several disconnected AD forests&lt;/b&gt; → Entra Cloud Sync&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Smart cards / legacy third-party MFA&lt;/b&gt; → AD FS federation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;No password prompt on domain-joined PCs&lt;/b&gt; → Seamless SSO (Kerberos) with PHS or PTA" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="770" width="866" height="81" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1_2" name="1.2 Hybrid identity architecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1531" pageHeight="794" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;1.2  Hybrid identity architecture&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="383" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Architecture" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="433" y="19" width="102" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="547" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="On-prem AD syncs to Entra ID. Conditional Access decides access from signals (user, group, app, device, location, risk); Identity Protection supplies the risk. The tenant is the identity boundary." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1432" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="Entra ID tenant = identity boundary (a subscription trusts one tenant)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0078D4;arcSize=3;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="651" y="100" width="520" height="371" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;Free&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="501" width="250" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;P1&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="501" width="250" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;P2&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="501" width="300" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;Licences&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="535" width="90" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="SSO and MFA, security defaults" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="535" width="250" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="Conditional Access" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="535" width="250" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="Identity Protection + PIM" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="535" width="300" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;Also&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="563" width="90" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="Security defaults = free basic MFA, no&lt;br&gt;premium licence" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="563" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="Authentication Strengths" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="563" width="250" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="SSPR with writeback needs Entra Connect; CAE&lt;br&gt;revokes tokens almost instantly" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="563" width="300" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="users, groups, hashes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="signals" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="allow / MFA / block" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="risk score" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#7F7F7F;dashed=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;On-prem Active&lt;br&gt;Directory&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Azure_AD_Domain_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121" y="140" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value='&lt;b&gt;Entra Connect Sync /&lt;br&gt;Cloud Sync&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: AD Connector)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Connect.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="415" y="140" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value='&lt;b&gt;Microsoft Entra ID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: IAM Identity Center)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Azure_Active_Directory.svg;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x="79" y="40" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Conditional Access&lt;br&gt;(P1)&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/security/Conditional_Access.svg;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x="394" y="40" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value='&lt;b&gt;Identity Protection&lt;br&gt;(P2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: GuardDuty (partial))&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_ID_Protection.svg;" vertex="1" parent="c2"><mxGeometry x="394" y="253" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;Apps and Azure&lt;br&gt;resources&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Enterprise_Applications.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1402" y="140" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="638" width="1432" height="97" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="642" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="&lt;b&gt;Block, require MFA or compliant device on a condition&lt;/b&gt; → Conditional Access (P1)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Risky users / sign-ins&lt;/b&gt; → Identity Protection (P2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Just-in-time admin roles&lt;/b&gt; → PIM (P2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Instant token revocation&lt;/b&gt; → Continuous Access Evaluation (CAE)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="664" width="1398" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1_3" name="1.3 External identities: partners and customers"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1352" pageHeight="809" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;1.3  External identities: partners and customers&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="557" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Architecture" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="607" y="19" width="102" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="721" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Partners come in as guests (B2B) with their own identity. B2B direct connect avoids a guest object (Teams shared channels). Consumers use a separate external tenant (External ID) with social login and your&lt;br&gt;branding." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1252" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="mutual trust, blocked by default" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Partner user (Entra, Google or&lt;br&gt;one-time passcode)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="210" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;B2B collaboration&lt;br&gt;(guest in your&lt;br&gt;directory)&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/External_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Your Entra tenant&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Azure_Active_Directory.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Partner user in a trusted&lt;br&gt;tenant&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="313" width="210" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;B2B direct connect (no&lt;br&gt;guest object)&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/External_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="313" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Teams shared channels&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/azure_ecosystem/Collaborative_Service.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="313" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;Consumers (self sign-up,&lt;br&gt;Google / Facebook)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="526" width="210" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value='&lt;b&gt;Entra External ID&lt;br&gt;(external tenant, your&lt;br&gt;branding)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: Cognito user pools)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/External_ID.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="526" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;Customer-facing app&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/compute/App_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="526" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="External ID replaces Azure AD B2C for new customers ⚠&lt;br&gt;verify dates." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="972" y="536" width="320" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="668" width="1252" height="81" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="672" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;Partner or vendor signs in with their own identity&lt;/b&gt; → B2B collaboration&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shared Teams channels without a guest object&lt;/b&gt; → B2B direct connect&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Millions of customers with social login&lt;/b&gt; → Entra External ID" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="694" width="1218" height="49" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1_4" name="1.4 Secretless access: managed identity, service principal, federation"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1342" pageHeight="869" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;1.4  Secretless access: managed identity, service principal, federation&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="824" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Architecture" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="874" y="19" width="102" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="988" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Managed identities have no secrets for Azure resources. System-assigned lives and dies with one resource; user-assigned is its own reusable resource. Workload identity federation gives GitHub Actions,&lt;br&gt;Kubernetes or other clouds access without secrets." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1242" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="token" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="RBAC" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="token" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="RBAC" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="federated token" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#5B9A00;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="RBAC" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#5B9A00;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value='&lt;b&gt;App Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: Elastic Beanstalk /&lt;br&gt;App Runner)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/compute/App_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value='&lt;b&gt;System-assigned&lt;br&gt;identity (one&lt;br&gt;resource, same&lt;br&gt;lifecycle)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: IAM role (instance&lt;br&gt;profile))&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value='&lt;b&gt;Key Vault&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: Secrets Manager)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/security/Key_Vaults.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="804" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value='&lt;b&gt;Several VMs / apps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: EC2)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/compute/Virtual_Machine.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="343" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value='&lt;b&gt;User-assigned identity&lt;br&gt;(own resource,&lt;br&gt;reusable)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: IAM role)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="343" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value='&lt;b&gt;Storage Account&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: S3)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/storage/Storage_Accounts.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="804" y="343" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions /&lt;br&gt;Kubernetes / other&lt;br&gt;cloud&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/devops/Azure_DevOps.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="586" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value='&lt;b&gt;Workload identity&lt;br&gt;federation (OIDC, no&lt;br&gt;secret)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: OIDC with IAM roles)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="586" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;Azure resources&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Resource_Groups.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="804" y="586" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value='&lt;b&gt;Service principal:&lt;br&gt;secret or certificate&lt;br&gt;you must rotate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: IAM user with access&lt;br&gt;keys)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#B8860B"&gt;avoid when possible&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/App_Registrations.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1182" y="343" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="729" width="1242" height="81" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="733" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;No credentials&lt;/b&gt; → managed identity&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;External pipeline without secrets&lt;/b&gt; → workload identity federation (OIDC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Minimum role&lt;/b&gt; → e.g. Key Vault Secrets User, not Contributor" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="755" width="1208" height="49" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1_5" name="1.5 Legacy and private apps"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="796" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;1.5  Legacy and private apps&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="325" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Architecture" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="375" y="19" width="102" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="489" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="Three services bring on-prem and legacy workloads to Entra without VPN or domain controllers." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="900" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value='&lt;b&gt;Entra Domain Services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: Managed Microsoft&lt;br&gt;AD)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Domain_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="84" y="100" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Managed domain with LDAP, Kerberos and NTLM, no domain controllers&lt;br&gt;to deploy. For legacy apps in lift-and-shift." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="234" y="100" width="420" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value='&lt;b&gt;Entra Application&lt;br&gt;Proxy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color="#C55A11"&gt;(AWS: Verified Access)&lt;/font&gt;' style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Enterprise_Applications.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="84" y="328" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Publishes internal web apps with SSO. An outbound on-prem connector&lt;br&gt;means no VPN and no inbound ports." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="234" y="328" width="420" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Entra Private Access&lt;/b&gt;" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=11;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Entra_Private_Access.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="84" y="556" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="ZTNA access to private non-web apps (TCP/UDP) without a VPN." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontSize=11;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="234" y="556" width="420" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#B8860B;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="656" width="900" height="81" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;EXAM RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B8860B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="660" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;LDAP / Kerberos / NTLM for lift-and-shift apps&lt;/b&gt; → Entra Domain Services&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Publish internal web app without VPN or inbound ports&lt;/b&gt; → Application Proxy&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ZTNA for non-web TCP/UDP apps without VPN&lt;/b&gt; → Entra Private Access" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="682" width="866" height="49" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="d1_6" name="1.6 Azure RBAC: scope, inheritance and roles"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1485" pageHeight="933" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;1.6  Azure RBAC: scope, inheritance and roles&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="522" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Architecture" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="572" y="19" width="102" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="AZ-305 domain: Identity, governance and monitoring (25-30%)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A8A8A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="686" y="19" width="420" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="An assignment is principal + role + scope. Scopes inherit downward and permissions add up. Entra roles (Global Admin) are a different plane and are not inherited from Azure RBAC." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1385" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;Owner&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="295" y="492" width="190" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;Contributor&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="485" y="492" width="190" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Reader&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="675" y="492" width="190" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;User Access Administrator&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF5FC;strokeColor=#0078D4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="865" y="492" width="230" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;What it can do&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="185" y="526" width="110" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="Everything" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="295" y="526" width="190" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="Everything except managing&lt;br&gt;access" style="rounded=0;whiteSp